      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Challenges in real data ---\n1. Missing values\n2. Duplicacy\n3. Outliers(Extreme Range)\n4. Data imbalance\n5. Unwanted columns\n6. Wrong Data Type\n7. Invalid index range\n8. Missing KPI(Key Performance Indicator)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
